 docs/security/project-autopilot-workspace-permissive.md | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/security/project-autopilot-workspace-permissive.md b/docs/security/project-autopilot-workspace-permissive.md
index 0f0f720f0..f6ff0fca0 100644
--- a/docs/security/project-autopilot-workspace-permissive.md
+++ b/docs/security/project-autopilot-workspace-permissive.md
@@ -52,6 +52,12 @@ required for bind-mounted development work, including `DAC_OVERRIDE`. The
 integration test uses the same production security arguments so it tests
 Landlock rather than failing earlier at ordinary Linux directory permissions.
 
+Mission executor containers also run with the invoking host user's UID and GID.
+This keeps files created in bind-mounted worktrees owned by the same host user
+that runs Git inspection, controller verification, rollback, and commit. A
+container running as root can otherwise create `root:root` mode-640 files that
+execute successfully but cannot be copied or read by the host verifier.
+
